  DisplayName: Weaver
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: You're a skilled weaver, crafting your pieces either by hand or by
    loom. Whether you revere yourself as an artist or not, none can deny the beauty
    of your craft. However, the life of a weaver isn't the most exciting one, and
    your fingers itch for an adventure. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be
    to Dexterity or Wisdom , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in
    Crafting, and you're trained in Basket Weaving Lore, Tapestry Lore, or Textile
    Lore. You gain the Specialty Crafting skill feat.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Lost Omens Tian Xia Character Guide
